        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-012531",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, during 2025, we participated in two horizontals developments in Oklahoma.",
        "start_character": 15915,
        "end_character": 16001
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-012531",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-012531-a85addb5d1647b6f",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-012531",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, the OSHA hazard communication standard, the Emergency Planning and Community Right-to-Know Act and comparable state statutes and any implementing regulations require that we organize and/or disclose information about hazardous materials used or produced in our operations and that this information be provided to employees, state and local governmental authorities and citizens.",
        "start_character": 49609,
        "end_character": 50000
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-012531",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-012531-a85addb5d1647b6f",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-012531",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In past 4 years as to farm-out of our interest, we have Horizontal development with ORRI as follows;",
        "start_character": 13707,
        "end_character": 13807
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-012531",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-012531-a85addb5d1647b6f",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-012531",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In the second half of 2025, we participated in two development projects in West Texas with 8.2% interest in the drilling of eight wells in Midland County, operated by Vital Energy, and with 27% interest in 15 wells in Reagan County operated by Double Eagle.",
        "start_character": 15597,
        "end_character": 15854
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-012531",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-012531-a85addb5d1647b6f",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-012531",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Nonetheless, if new or more stringent federal, state, or local legal restrictions relating to the hydraulic fracturing process are adopted in areas where we operate, we may be required to incur significant added costs to comply with such requirements, experience delays or curtailment in the pursuit of exploration, development or production activities and perhaps even be precluded from drilling wells.",
        "start_character": 46210,
        "end_character": 46613
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-012531",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-012531-a85addb5d1647b6f",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-012531",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Proposals may be received on the remaining 1,870 acres, however, rather than participate we may choose to sell the acreage or farm-out, receiving cash and retaining an over-riding royalty interest (ORRI).",
        "start_character": 13502,
        "end_character": 13706
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-012531",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-012531-a85addb5d1647b6f",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-012531",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The EPA approved final attainment/nonattainment designations with the new ozone standards in July 2018 and currently all of the areas in which we operate are in attainment with such standards.",
        "start_character": 38828,
        "end_character": 39020
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-012531",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-012531-a85addb5d1647b6f",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-012531",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The designation as threatened or endangered of previously unprotected species in areas where we operate could cause us to incur increased costs arising from species protection measures or could result in limitations on our development and production activities that could have a material adverse impact on our ability to develop and produce our reserves.",
        "start_character": 48922,
        "end_character": 49276
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001437749-26-012531",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001437749-26-012531-a85addb5d1647b6f",
        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-012531",
